  "changes": [
    "Separate v5 package and launchers; legacy and v4 frozen.",
    "Bright-planet local absence evidence and candidate ranking; astrometric fits unchanged.",
    "Audit JSON, CSV and PDF evidence; same-epoch overlays regenerated after ranking.",
    "Image-only sky-footprint masking excludes dark exterior frames before association; no OCR or metadata.",
    "Non-finite intermediate ZPN trials are audited and skipped without changing the fixed camera.",
    "The v5 PDF omits the crowded planet-epoch appendix and hidden-metadata placeholder title while retaining standalone audit products.",
    "Document the Espenak three-planet diagnostic and proposed joint geometry and relative-brightness scoring.",
    "Do not select or display an epoch from single-planet aliases; retain all aliases as audit evidence.",
    "Split FITS output into a conventional 2-D primary image for solve-field and a separate full-colour annotated product.",
    "Add a third report page with one-row camera R/G/B versus Gaia RP/G/BP plots, smaller magnitudes toward the upper right, and only the labelled OLS fit line, without altering fitted quantities."
  ],
